Hello ALSA developers,=0A=
=0A=
I would like to report what appears to be another Lenovo ThinkPad SN6140 fi=
xup issue.=0A=
=0A=
Hardware=0A=
--------=0A=
Laptop: Lenovo ThinkPad E16 Gen 4=0A=
CPU: Intel Core Ultra 7 355=0A=
Audio controller: Intel HD Audio (8086:e428)=0A=
Codec: Conexant SN6140=0A=
Subsystem ID: 17aa:513f=0A=
=0A=
Software=0A=
--------=0A=
Distribution: CachyOS (Arch Linux based)=0A=
Kernel: 7.1.3-2-cachyos=0A=
PipeWire: 1.6.8=0A=
=0A=
Problem=0A=
-------=0A=
The internal speakers produce no sound.=0A=
=0A=
PipeWire, WirePlumber and ALSA all detect the device correctly. The analog =
sink is present and can be selected. Mixer controls are unmuted and speaker=
 volume is at 100%.=0A=
=0A=
The codec reports:=0A=
=0A=
Subsystem Id: 0x17aa513f=0A=
=0A=
However, during boot I see:=0A=
=0A=
snd_hda_codec_conexant hdaudioC0D0: SN6140: BIOS auto-probing.=0A=
snd_hda_codec_conexant hdaudioC0D0: SN6140: picked fixup for PCI SSID 17aa:=
0000=0A=
=0A=
This looks very similar to the recently reported SN6140 Lenovo issues where=
 the driver falls back to PCI SSID 17aa:0000 instead of using the actual Le=
novo subsystem ID.=0A=
=0A=
Relevant ALSA information:=0A=
=0A=
00:1f.3 Multimedia audio controller:=0A=
Intel Corporation Core Ultra Processors (Series 3) HD Audio [8086:e428]=0A=
=0A=
Kernel driver in use:=0A=
snd_hda_intel=0A=
=0A=
Playback devices:=0A=
=0A=
card 0: PCH=0A=
device 0: SN6140 Analog=0A=
=0A=
Mixer settings:=0A=
=0A=
Master: 100%=0A=
Speaker: 100% (unmuted)=0A=
PCM: 100%=0A=
Auto-Mute: Disabled=0A=
=0A=
Pin widget:=0A=
=0A=
GET_PIN_WIDGET_CONTROL (0x17): 0x40=0A=
GET_AMP_GAIN_MUTE (0x17): 0x00=0A=
=0A=
PipeWire detects the analog sink correctly and sets it as default.=0A=
=0A=
Could this ThinkPad E16 Gen 4 (Subsystem ID 17aa:513f) require a new Conexa=
nt SN6140 fixup similar to the recently added Lenovo ThinkPad models?=0A=
=0A=
If additional diagnostics are needed (alsa-info.sh output, codec dump, dmes=
g, etc.) I would be happy to provide them.=0A=
=0A=
Thank you very much for your work.=0A=
=0A=
Best regards,=0A=
Wilko Waitz=

